ure to defeat the legendary Hockey Godz. Create your own character, level up your stats, and unlock new gear in this hockey RPG campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR CHARACTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/f9e2da1e80c0ca030492672281c1bfbd.poster.avif?t=1771515439\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/f9e2da1e80c0ca030492672281c1bfbd.webm?t=1771515439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/f9e2da1e80c0ca030492672281c1bfbd.mp4?t=1771515439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>PLAY SOME HOCKEY </strong><br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/a740d70c1a1c1bf7113e2a8609b0d5f6.poster.avif?t=1771515439\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/a740d70c1a1c1bf7113e2a8609b0d5f6.webm?t=1771515439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/a740d70c1a1c1bf7113e2a8609b0d5f6.mp4?t=1771515439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br> <strong>DRIVE ACROSS THE COUNTRY</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/c6901217b7b1d80abad4898c4103160a.poster.avif?t=1771515439\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/c6901217b7b1d80abad4898c4103160a.webm?t=1771515439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/c6901217b7b1d80abad4898c4103160a.mp4?t=1771515439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>MANAGE YOUR GEAR AND STATS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/987c367075c8e4a4aa34efd6955e13c5.avif?t=1771515439\" width=800 height=400 /></span><strong>BATTLE THE BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/1e548149980081088426b9ad70d19ae6.poster.avif?t=1771515439\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/1e548149980081088426b9ad70d19ae6.webm?t=1771515439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/1e548149980081088426b9ad70d19ae6.mp4?t=1771515439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>EXPERIENCE THE WORLD OF SHORESY</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHINNY MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER: COMPETITIVE, and CO-OP.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Go head-to-head with friends in the local multiplayer Shinny Mode by drafting your team of fan-favourite characters to run ‘em up and fill ‘em in. Charge your fight meter to knock out your rivals or grab a power-up to gain an edge. Works with Steam remote play for online fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAFT YOUR TEAM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/72fcaf3450ad8deaf2f2ac54df2d3b7c.poster.avif?t=1771515439\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/72fcaf3450ad8deaf2f2ac54df2d3b7c.webm?t=1771515439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/72fcaf3450ad8deaf2f2ac54df2d3b7c.mp4?t=1771515439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A REASON TO GET TOGETHER ON A SUDBURY SATURDAY NIGHT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/6d1768079ed30ecc53d046b1295e6ac7.poster.avif?t=1771515439\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/6d1768079ed30ecc53d046b1295e6ac7.webm?t=1771515439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/6d1768079ed30ecc53d046b1295e6ac7.mp4?t=1771515439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/542a09016fb86b2425b4fec313d62518.avif?t=1771515439\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras_big/542a09016fb86b2425b4fec313d62518.avif?t=1771515439 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You ready? Good, ‘cause you’re going!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/b5372eba67b0b6bb3c9bbf149760ce08.avif?t=1771515439\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras_big/b5372eba67b0b6bb3c9bbf149760ce08.avif?t=1771515439 width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SHORESY</strong></i><strong>,</strong> created by and starring Jared Keeso and produced by New Metric Media in association with Play Fun Games and Crave, sees the titular character Shoresy (Keeso) and the Sudbury Bulldogs of the Northern Ontario Senior Hockey Organization (The NOSHO) on a quest to never lose again. SHORESY returned for season four on Crave in Canada in January, and Hulu in the US in February, with seasons one through three streaming on the platforms, as well. The fifth season of the series completed production in April, with a premiere date to be announced.</p>",
